<title>UK: Deutsche sets bull-spread warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets bull-spread warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued five million European-style capped call warrants on dollar/mark, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.65 DEM		  ISSUE PRICE  2.75 DEM</p>
<p> CAP LEVEL	 1.75 DEM</p>
<p> EXERCISE DATE   16.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	05.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1.6510 DEM</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
